# {{.ProjectName}}

Express API with layered architecture.

## Stack

- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Framework:** Express

## Quick Start

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Endpoints

- `POST /api/items` — Create an item
- `GET  /api/items` — List all items
- `GET  /api/items/:id` — Get item by ID
- `PUT  /api/items/:id` — Update an item
- `DELETE /api/items/:id` — Delete an item
